{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/934928-why-isn-t-onyx-path-in-the-ennies-this-year","id":934928,"title":"Why isn't Onyx Path in the ENnies this year?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-20T23:09:44-07:00","id":934928,"title":"Why isn't Onyx Path in the ENnies this year?","content":"The ENnies are the biggest award show in the tabletop industry, yet Onyx Path isn't in the voting pool at all. Beyond that, it seems like Onyx Path has <i>never</i> been in the ENnies. What gives? As far as I know it just takes a simple submission, and it seems silly to miss out on prestige when it's so readily available.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T06:51:25-07:00","id":935034,"title":"","content":"I have no control over the fact that what I'm about to say is true, but I'm pretty positive that what happened is that we didn't submit ourselves.<br /> <br /> Which, again, I have no personal control over. That's just what happened. No conspiracy, nothing insidious, no losing because of a &quot;bad&quot; game. We didn't submit ourselves. I can't tell you why, I can't tell you any of that. I don't know why. I just know that's what happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T07:10:59-07:00","id":935041,"title":"","content":"'<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Products submitted for consideration must be samples of those primarily available to the general public.'<br /> <br /> It's possible they aren't allowed due to selling online.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T07:14:45-07:00","id":935042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/934928-why-isn-t-onyx-path-in-the-ennies-this-year?p=935041#post935041\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Products submitted for consideration must be samples of those primarily available to the general public.'<br /> <br /> It's possible they aren't allowed due to selling online.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty positive that's not what it was.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T07:16:58-07:00","id":935043,"title":"","content":"Yes, they do say you can get in just selling online in their otherwise hard to reach FAQ. So they just haven't submitted themselves. Apparently they were nominated for a fan favorite a few years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-23T22:40:52-07:00","id":936427,"title":"","content":"Rich discussed this in a Monday Meeting blog post - he didn't submit anything because he didn't feel like submitting works with the business strategy right now. Awards apparently don't grow the audience or increase sales. Plus, since Onyx Path don't carry physical inventory, they have to pay for every submission to be printed, which is about 4-8 books a submission, and can get pretty expensive with some of their books","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T16:58:18-07:00","id":936797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/934928-why-isn-t-onyx-path-in-the-ennies-this-year?p=936427#post936427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rich discussed this in a Monday Meeting blog post - he didn't submit anything because he didn't feel like submitting works with the business strategy right now. Awards apparently don't grow the audience or increase sales. Plus, since Onyx Path don't carry physical inventory, they have to pay for every submission to be printed, which is about 4-8 books a submission, and can get pretty expensive with some of their books</div> </div> </div> </div>M20 <b><i>alone</i></b> would be.....what?....few <i>hundred</i> bucks?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-25T11:18:59-07:00","id":937181,"title":"","content":"Yeah, we're eligible, but have chosen not to submit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T02:56:07-07:00","id":938007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/934928-why-isn-t-onyx-path-in-the-ennies-this-year?p=936797#post936797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">M20 <b><i>alone</i></b> would be.....what?....few <i>hundred</i> bucks?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mage 20 is $65 on DriveThruRPG, so that's $260 for 4 and $520 for 8, both standard edition. For the fancy version however it's $460 and $920.<br /> <br /> That's quite a bit of money for something that has only a limited chance for a ROI.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12